# Level $12's start ($81:8623): the level with an escort that loads the
# second palette set ($48, $81:865D). No script starts that level; the
# trace scripts start from saved states already in it. Started here as
# the stage states are made: the first password, with act 6 and stage 0
# held through the password check and the level start
# (tools/aladdin/states/03_stages.box).
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
press DOWN
wait 30
press START
wait 150
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press START
repeat 600
poke $00035C 06
poke $00035D 00
wait 1
end
press START
repeat 900
poke $00035C 06
poke $00035D 00
wait 1
end
wait 30
